# 14. Pause, stop, and recover interrupted workflows

**Type:** AFK  
**Status:** Ready to implement once dependencies are complete  
**User stories:** US-8  
**Source:** [PRD.md](../../PRD.md)  
**Implementation order:** Approved by the user on 2026-10-14

## What to build

Expose /ralph-pause, /ralph-resume and /ralph-stop in OpenCode and recover interrupted workflows safely. Reconcile persisted intents with actual Git refs, worktrees, sessions, processes and validation evidence before presenting a recovery summary. Require an explicit resume instruction after restart. Cover execution, questions, merge publication and review repairs without repeating completed side effects or resetting budgets.

